[
  {
    "title": "Data Analysis, Visualisation & Evidence",
    "tag": "LESSON 08",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 2 · From data to a defensible claim",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Data Analysis<br>&amp; Evidence</h1><p class=\"zh\">数据分析 · 可视化 · 证据与结论</p><p class=\"small\">Chapter 2 investigation · 90 minutes</p>",
    "note": "本课用L07清洗后的同一合成通勤表，把“表格能用”推进到“结论有证据且不过度推广”。学生要实际使用程序筛选、计算、看图，并写一份证据简报。无需写列表或循环代码。资料中的通勤数据完全合成，不代表真实学校、学生或研究发现。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Three tools from this chapter",
    "tag": "CHAPTER 2 RETRIEVAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A/D · DAT-2.B/C",
    "html": "<ol><li>Does a higher sample count automatically increase the number of value levels?</li><li>Which kind of compression permits exact reconstruction of the original data?</li><li>Why do commute values need a unit label?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. <strong>No.</strong> Time sampling and value precision are separate.<br>2. <strong>Lossless.</strong><br>3. A value such as 30 is ambiguous without knowing it means minutes rather than another unit.</div></details>",
    "note": "三题分别回顾采样、压缩、元数据。每题用一句解释，避免直接唱答案。lossless的精确对象是输入的原始数字数据，不是数字化之前模拟世界的全部细节。单位与采集背景在分析中仍然必要，不会因为已经清洗完而失去作用。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Build an evidence brief",
    "tag": "LEARNING GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.A · DAT-2.D · DAT-2.E",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 248\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Evidence brief workflow: question, data view, statistics, chart and scoped claim. Decisions and limitations accompany all steps.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"45\" width=\"220\" height=\"105\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Question</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">What can we ask?</text><path d=\"M228 96L246 96\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M236 89L246 96L236 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"45\" width=\"220\" height=\"105\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Data</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Choose a view</text><path d=\"M470 96L488 96\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M478 89L488 96L478 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"492\" y=\"45\" width=\"220\" height=\"105\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"602\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Statistics</text><text x=\"602\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Summarize</text><path d=\"M712 96L730 96\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M720 89L730 96L720 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"734\" y=\"45\" width=\"220\" height=\"105\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"844\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Chart</text><text x=\"844\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Show the pattern</text><path d=\"M954 96L972 96\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M962 89L972 96L962 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"976\" y=\"45\" width=\"220\" height=\"105\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1086\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Claim</text><text x=\"1086\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">State the scope</text><path d=\"M110 181L1090 181\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Keep a decision log and a limitation alongside the evidence.</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">Deliver: one question, two statistics, one chart, one limitation and a decision log.</p>",
    "note": "指出本节的交付物是分析简报，不是正式Create项目，也不是一段自动生成的“答案”。数量证据、图表和限制必须指向同一个问题。教师应看到学生真实切换筛选、核对样本数，而不是只抄最终均值表。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Start with a question that fits the data",
    "tag": "QUESTION FIRST",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.A.1–2",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Fields: response ID, main mode, minutes, distance in km.</p><div class=\"columns\"><div><h3>Addressable</h3><p>How do reported commute times differ by mode in this sample?</p></div><div><h3>Not established by this table</h3><p>Which mode would make every student arrive faster?</p></div></div><p>What information is missing for the second question?</p><details><summary>Show examples</summary><div class=\"answer\">Comparable routes and distances, repeated conditions, and evidence about what happens when a person changes mode.</div></details>",
    "note": "问题要从字段和采集过程出发。第一问描述样本内关联，可以分析；第二问包含反事实与因果判断，这张自愿单次表不足以回答。接受其他缺失信息如路况、等待时间，但不能把任何单一补充字段说成足以证明因果。表里已有distance，可用它提示不同模式人群并不相同。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Use the documented baseline",
    "tag": "FROM L07 TO L08",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B/C · DAT-2.E.2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sixteen raw rows become thirteen usable records after excluding one duplicate, one missing time and one negative time. Mode labels are standardized; 120 minutes is kept.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"40\" width=\"310\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">16 raw rows</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">preserve the source</text><path d=\"M335 93L450 93\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M440 86L450 93L440 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"463\" y=\"40\" width=\"350\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"638.0\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Apply documented rules</text><text x=\"638.0\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">standardize and check</text><path d=\"M813 93L875 93\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M865 86L875 93L865 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"885\" y=\"40\" width=\"290\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1030.0\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">13 usable records</text><text x=\"1030.0\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">120 min retained</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Exclude: 1 repeated ID + 1 missing time + 1 negative time</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">Keep the <strong>120-minute value</strong>; flag it as unusual.</p><p class=\"small\">Synthetic classroom data: a voluntary survey at one school on one morning.</p>",
    "note": "逐项核对16减3为13，标准化 bus 不删行。所有主分析默认保留120；无证据不能因为它拉高均值就判错。清洗规则存于data/chapter2-commute.json并由实验程序应用。若学生试算原始16行，把问题拉回已经定义的分析集合；保留原始表和排除日志，不覆盖数据来源。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Sorting and filtering do different jobs",
    "tag": "ORGANIZE VS SELECT",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.4–6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 265\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three-row excerpt: Bus25,Walk10,Bus30. Sorting gives Walk10,Bus25,Bus30; filtering for Bus keeps only Bus25 and Bus30.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Original excerpt</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Sort by minutes</text><text x=\"1030\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Filter: Bus only</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"60\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Bus · 25 min</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"125\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Walk · 10 min</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"190\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Bus · 30 min</text><rect x=\"457\" y=\"60\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"597\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Walk · 10 min</text><rect x=\"457\" y=\"125\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"597\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Bus · 25 min</text><rect x=\"457\" y=\"190\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"597\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Bus · 30 min</text><rect x=\"889\" y=\"60\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1029\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Bus · 25 min</text><rect x=\"889\" y=\"125\" width=\"280\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1029\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Bus · 30 min</text><path d=\"M309 150L433 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M423 143L433 150L423 157\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g></svg><figcaption>Illustrative excerpt. In the full baseline, sorting keeps 13 records; filtering Bus selects 6.</figcaption></figure><p>Does sorting alone change the mean of these values?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>No.</strong> The same values and count remain. A filter can change which values contribute.</div></details>",
    "note": "用三张数值卡片打乱再重排，学生看到和与数量未变。筛选保留Bus是一种分析视图，不等于把其他模式从原始数据中永久删除。排序有助于找中位数，但并不把最大值删除。实验已有模式筛选，无需学生编写布尔条件或假设有排序按钮。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Mean and median answer different questions",
    "tag": "SUMMARIZE",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.6 · Classroom statistical tools",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sorted thirteen times with seventh value 20 highlighted. Mean is 381 divided by 13, about29.31 minutes; median20.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sorted commute times · minutes</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"49\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">8</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"141\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">10</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"233\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">12</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"325\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">15</text><rect x=\"376\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"417\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">15</text><rect x=\"468\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"509\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">18</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"601\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">20</text><rect x=\"652\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"693\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">25</text><rect x=\"744\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">28</text><rect x=\"836\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"877\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><rect x=\"928\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"969\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">35</text><rect x=\"1020\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1061\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">45</text><rect x=\"1112\" y=\"56\" width=\"82\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fbf1dc\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1153\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">120</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">6 values ← 7th value → 6 values</text><rect x=\"45\" y=\"211\" width=\"525\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"307.5\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Mean = 381 ÷ 13 ≈ 29.31</text><text x=\"307.5\" y=\"291\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Uses every value, including 120</text><rect x=\"627\" y=\"211\" width=\"525\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"889.5\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Median = 20</text><text x=\"889.5\" y=\"291\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">The middle of the sorted values</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Both summaries use all 13 retained records, including 120 minutes.</p>",
    "note": "先核对排序与13个数，中位数为第7个20，平均为381/13。均值和中位数是本课用于汇总的数学工具，并非要学生把它们当额外官方AP统计公式清单。120相对大，会使均值与中位数相差较明显；不要马上因此宣布中位数唯一正确。两种量回答不同概括问题，报告应说清选择。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Compare groups and report the counts",
    "tag": "GROUP SUMMARIES",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.1/6",
    "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th>n</th><th>Mean minutes</th><th>Median minutes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Walk</td><td>4</td><td>11.25</td><td>11</td></tr><tr><td>Bike</td><td>3</td><td>17.67</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>Bus</td><td>6</td><td>47.17</td><td>32.5</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"callout\">These describe the retained records, not every journey by each mode.</p><p>Which group has the largest mean in this sample?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>Bus.</strong> Its mean is about 47.17 minutes across 6 retained responses.</div></details>",
    "note": "均值保留两位小数，内部计算不先四舍五入。Bike的53/3约17.6667，Bus的283/6约47.1667，展示17.67与47.17。Bus中位数为排序后30和35的平均32.5。强调每组人数不同，不能把三个组均值直接简单平均当全样本均值。计数n是解释统计证据的一部分。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Make the chart tell the same story as the data",
    "tag": "VISUALIZE",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.2/6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 310\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Zero-based mean-time bar chart in minutes: Walk11.25 n4; Bike17.67 n3; Bus47.17 n6. Axis0to60.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><path d=\"M180 25L180 232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0</text><path d=\"M310 25L310 232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">10</text><path d=\"M440 25L440 232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"440\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">20</text><path d=\"M570 25L570 232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"570\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">30</text><path d=\"M700 25L700 232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"700\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">40</text><path d=\"M830 25L830 232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">50</text><path d=\"M960 25L960 232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"960\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">60</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">Walk</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"38\" width=\"146.25\" height=\"42\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"339.25\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">11.25 (n=4)</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">Bike</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"105\" width=\"229.66666666666669\" height=\"42\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"422.6666666666667\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">17.67 (n=3)</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">Bus</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"172\" width=\"613.1666666666666\" height=\"42\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"806.1666666666666\" y=\"203\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">47.17 (n=6)</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"289\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Mean reported one-way commute time · minutes</text></g></svg><figcaption>Synthetic voluntary sample · cleaned n = 13 · 120-minute record retained</figcaption></figure><p>What does the length of a bar summarize?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">The <strong>group mean</strong>, not every individual travel time. The chart also labels group counts.</div></details>",
    "note": "图为静态SVG，横向条形从零起，长度表示均值，不是人数。先读标题、单位、图形编码与caption，再看谁更长。学生不能从组均值图读出全部个体分布；要看原记录或其他图才知道组内差异。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Use language that matches the evidence",
    "tag": "CLAIM + EVIDENCE + SCOPE",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.A.1–3",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Weak: “Buses make students late.”</p><p class=\"callout\">Stronger: “Among the 13 retained responses in this synthetic sample, Bus has the highest mean reported commute time: 47.17 minutes (n = 6).”</p><p>Name two improvements in the revised claim.</p><details><summary>Show possible answers</summary><div class=\"answer\">It identifies the sample and statistic, gives a number with units and count, and avoids claiming a causal effect or measuring lateness.</div></details>",
    "note": "弱句含两个跳跃：时间长并不等于迟到，因为没有arrivaldeadline字段；选择Bus和时间关联也不证明Bus造成。强句陈述已观察统计，明确本合成样本与n。词语如“proves”“all students”“best”需要特别检查。训练不是把所有结论都写得含糊，而是具体说数据实际支持什么。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Keep an unusual value; test sensitivity separately",
    "tag": "SENSITIVITY ANALYSIS",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.2 · DAT-2.E.1–2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sensitivity comparison. Baseline keeps120: n13 mean29.31 median20 minutes. Alternative omits120: n12 mean21.75 median19.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">All-record mean · minutes (axis starts at zero)</text><path d=\"M330 56L330 223\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0</text><path d=\"M510 56L510 223\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">10</text><path d=\"M690 56L690 223\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"690\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">20</text><path d=\"M870 56L870 223\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"870\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">30</text><path d=\"M960 56L960 223\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"960\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">35</text><text x=\"304\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">Keep 120</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"78\" width=\"527.5384615384615\" height=\"39\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"867.5384615384615\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">29.31</text><text x=\"27\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">n=13 · median 20 min</text><text x=\"304\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">Omit 120</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"164\" width=\"391.5\" height=\"39\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"731.5\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">21.75</text><text x=\"27\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">n=12 · median 19 min</text></g></svg><figcaption>Bus mean also changes: 47.17 (n=6) → 32.60 minutes (n=5).</figcaption></figure><p>Does this change prove the 120-minute response is wrong?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>No.</strong> It shows sensitivity to this observation. Keep the baseline without evidence of an error and label the alternative.</div></details>",
    "note": "敏感性分析用明确替代选择观察结论稳定程度，不是“清洗掉不喜欢的数”。默认保留120，只有可验证错误或明确分析规则才改变主数据集。Bus删120后剩25、28、30、35、45，均值32.6；全样本均值从381/13降到261/12。教师不要说“修正后的均值21.75”，应说“排除120的替代视图”。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Association is not proof of cause",
    "tag": "ALTERNATIVE EXPLANATIONS",
    "time": "40–44 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.A.3–4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Distance may affect both mode choice and travel time. A dashed link between mode and time represents observed association, not an established causal effect.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"422\" y=\"12\" width=\"360\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fbf1dc\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Distance</text><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">possible confounding factor</text><path d=\"M423 107L276 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M781 107L929 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"255\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">may affect</text><text x=\"939\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">may affect</text><rect x=\"35\" y=\"180\" width=\"450\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"223\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Choice of mode</text><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Walk / Bike / Bus</text><rect x=\"715\" y=\"180\" width=\"450\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"940.0\" y=\"223\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Commute time</text><text x=\"940.0\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">reported minutes</text><path d=\"M488 235L713 235\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 7\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Observed association does not isolate a causal effect.</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Mean distance: Walk 0.78 km · Bike 3.50 km · Bus 6.17 km.</p><p class=\"callout\">Comparing these groups does not hold distance constant.</p>",
    "note": "依据同13行独立计算距离均值0.775、3.5、6.1667，展示两位小数。没有声称已建立统计显著相关，也没有声称控制距离一定推翻结论。距离、路况和等待时间都可能有关，需要更完整、可比较资料和研究设计才能讨论因果。教“does not prove”而非“correlation means there is never causation”。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A clean sample can still be unrepresentative",
    "tag": "SCOPE & BIAS",
    "time": "44–48 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B · DAT-2.C.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 310\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Schematic school population contains respondents and nonrespondents. Only volunteers enter the sample, so cleaning cannot ensure representativeness.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"40\" width=\"510\" height=\"205\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Students at one school</text><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><circle cx=\"138\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><circle cx=\"234\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"378\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"426\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"474\" cy=\"123\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"138\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"234\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"378\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"426\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><circle cx=\"474\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c0ccd5\"/><path d=\"M547 149L668 149\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M658 142L668 149L658 156\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"690\" y=\"97\" width=\"470\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Voluntary responses</text><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Who chooses to respond?</text><text x=\"603\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Accurate rows ≠ a representative collection process</text></g></svg><figcaption>Conceptual illustration, not the 16-row dataset. One school and one morning also limit scope.</figcaption></figure><p>Would more responses from the same biased process automatically remove the bias?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>No.</strong> More data may improve some estimates, but the source and collection process still matter.</div></details>",
    "note": "合成数据设计说明与对其假想采集过程的分析应分开：这些不是真实参与者；为了练习，按“一校一晨自愿调查”情境讨论限制。不要因为是合成资料就说无须思考抽样偏差，也不要用它作现实交通建议。metadata/provenance包括字段单位、来源、采集方式和处理记录，不只有文件大小。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Programs help scale analysis; checks still matter",
    "tag": "USING PROGRAMS WITH DATA",
    "time": "48–51 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.1/7–8 · DAT-2.D/E",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\"><div><h3>Useful work</h3><p>Repeat filters, compute summaries, transform units and redraw charts.</p></div><div><h3>Human decisions</h3><p>Choose the question, validate rules and judge whether a claim is supported.</p></div></div><p class=\"callout\">Large datasets may require more storage, computation or multiple computers.</p><p class=\"small\">A fast calculation can still use incorrect units, biased inputs or the wrong filter.</p>",
    "note": "当前13行可手算核查，较大数据通过程序才能有效重复处理，但程序能做并不等于自动正确。举例错误单位乘60也可迅速给出大量错误数值。C.7/C.8仅引入规模、资源和可能多计算机处理的需求，不教并行算法或系统设计，不声称本课掌握完整可扩展计算。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Your investigation brief",
    "tag": "PROJECT BRIEF",
    "time": "51–55 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D · DAT-2.E",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_2_Data_Lab.html#data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Data Lab → Data analysis</a> · <a href=\"output/pdf/AP_CSP_Chapter_2_Investigation_Sheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Investigation sheet</a></p><ol><li>One question and the exact analysis view.</li><li>Two statistics with units and sample counts.</li><li>One labeled chart and one evidence-based claim.</li><li>A limitation plus cleaning / sensitivity decisions.</li></ol><p class=\"small\">Use the supplied synthetic data. Save your own completed brief.</p>",
    "note": "明确28分钟项目时间从55到83分钟。学生可纸笔填调查单，图表可准确临摹当前实验图并标轴、单位、n和处理视图，不依赖未实现的导出按钮。全班相同资料仍应各自写解释。二人共用设备必须交换操作，最后每人都能解释数字来源。该活动是数据调查练习，不叫正式Create任务。"
  },
  {
    "title": "1 · Choose the question and document the view",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATION · 5 MINUTES",
    "time": "55–60 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.A · DAT-2.B/C",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Start with the baseline: <strong>13 retained records, including 120</strong>.</p><ol><li>Write an answerable question about time and mode.</li><li>Record units, source and the 16 → 13 cleaning decisions.</li><li>Predict what comparison would address the question.</li></ol><details><summary>Show a possible starting point</summary><div class=\"answer\">Example: “How do the mean reported times of Bus and Bike differ in this retained sample?” Compare each filtered mean and record both counts.</div></details>",
    "note": "5分钟先个人定问题，再同伴用字段表检查能否回答。提议学生比较Bus/Bike、Walk/Bike或全体均值中位数均可，但需要说明同一个分析目标。确定原始120保留，不因想得到某个结论预先删值。预测可以错；之后证据纠正预测本身是学习目标。"
  },
  {
    "title": "2 · Use the program and verify two statistics",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATION · 7 MINUTES",
    "time": "60–67 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.1/4/6",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Use the mode filter. Record values before changing the view.</p><ol><li>Select the views needed for your question.</li><li>Write two statistics with <strong>units and n</strong>.</li><li>Verify one small group using its displayed records.</li></ol><details><summary>Show baseline checks</summary><div class=\"answer\">Baseline examples: Walk mean <strong>11.25 min, n=4</strong>; Bike mean <strong>17.67 min, n=3</strong>; Bus mean <strong>47.17 min, n=6</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "前4分钟操作与抄录，后3分钟交换角色手算一组，如Walk(8+10+12+15)/4=11.25。必须检查过滤器是否已回到需要的视图，防止把Bus统计和All计数拼在一起。实验内部保留精度，展示两位小数允许一致四舍五入。屏幕没显示的统计不要凭视觉猜；可用表中数据手算并注明方法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "3 · Turn the comparison into a readable chart",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATION · 5 MINUTES",
    "time": "67–72 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.2/6",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Record or sketch the group-mean chart from the lab.</p><ul><li>Use a title naming the statistic and population shown.</li><li>Label mode categories and minutes; start bars at zero.</li><li>Show group counts and the treatment of 120.</li><li>Check that your written numbers match the chart’s view.</li></ul><details><summary>Show a caption example</summary><div class=\"answer\">A suitable caption: “Mean reported one-way time by mode; synthetic retained sample; Walk n=4, Bike n=3, Bus n=6; 120 retained.”</div></details>",
    "note": "如果当前lab模式筛选只突出组或只显示所选记录，要求先回到All观察完整组图，再标记选定比较；根据实际界面数据写，不杜撰不同视图。条形以零作为起点更适合比较长度。图表美化不计本次目标分，标题、单位、计数和与数字一致更重要。也要指出组均值图不展示个体差异。"
  },
  {
    "title": "4 · Check sensitivity and state one limitation",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATION · 6 MINUTES",
    "time": "72–78 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.A.3 · DAT-2.C.5 · DAT-2.E.1",
    "html": "<ol><li>Record the baseline before omitting 120.</li><li>Use the optional omission view; describe a change.</li><li>Restore the baseline and label the alternative clearly.</li><li>Write one limitation that your calculation cannot remove.</li></ol><details><summary>Show a comparison and limitation</summary><div class=\"answer\">All mean: <strong>29.31 → 21.75 min</strong>; n: <strong>13 → 12</strong>.<br>Possible limitation: one voluntary single-morning sample cannot establish population-wide or causal conclusions.</div></details>",
    "note": "敏感性实验并不要求学生改变主要结论，观察保持或变化都可。用全体均值便于同一检查；若学生只研究Walk/Bike，说明删除Bus记录不改变这两组均值，因此也可形成有价值的稳定性陈述。记录操作后恢复默认，简报写baseline和alternative，防止下一位用户误把删120后数据当主结果。"
  },
  {
    "title": "5 · Review the claim and revise it",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATION · 5 MINUTES",
    "time": "78–83 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.2 · DAT-2.E.1",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Swap briefs. Check one another’s evidence.</p><ol><li>Can you reproduce the statistics from the stated view?</li><li>Does the claim use the same units, groups and sample?</li><li>Does it confuse association with cause?</li><li>Is every exclusion or alternate view disclosed?</li></ol><details><summary>Show one useful revision</summary><div class=\"answer\">Example revision: replace “Bus causes longer commutes” with “Bus has a higher mean in this retained sample; distance and collection differences may also matter.”</div></details>",
    "note": "先2分钟审阅，2分钟修改，最后1分钟每人圈出具体改进句子。不能仅签“looks good”，至少核对一个数字和一个限制。要求保留初稿或用不同笔标注更改，体现反馈后修订。若同伴发现计算不一致，回到原始13行和当前filter检查，而不是选择更符合直觉的数字。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Chapter 2 check and hand-in",
    "tag": "CONSOLIDATION",
    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "L05–L08 · Original practice",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Submit your evidence brief and decision log.</p><p>Homework: <strong>12 questions · 30 classroom marks · about 40 minutes</strong>.</p><ul><li>Sampling and compression retrieval.</li><li>Data quality, filtering and aggregation.</li><li>Charts, sensitivity and justified claims.</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Use the provided figures and show your reasoning; the worksheet is not an official AP FRQ.</p>",
    "note": "本课作业是第二章综合检查，既有本课也有采样、压缩和数据质量。提醒Q5为恰选两项，4分书面题采用教师评分。分析简报可以在课后补充图表整洁度，但核心数字、操作与判断应在课内完成，便于观察真实理解。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Which two claims are supported?",
